id=fiio_m33_audiotrack_noretrack
name=FiiO M33 R2R A/V sync fix (AudioTrack no-retrack)
version=v1.2
versionCode=12
author=ryanmagoon
description=Patches the device's own libaudioclient.so (skip forced AudioTrack recreation on start), libfiioaudio.so (do not reset the processing ring buffers when parameters are unchanged) and audio.primary.bengal.so (correct frame size in the presentation position; fixes 2x position rate in NOS mode). Ships no FiiO binaries.
updateJson=
